">Instable Vortex</a> on the west of the chamber. They will turn into a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shimmying%20Butterfly\">Shimmying Butterfly</a>. You have limited time to do this.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As announced on February 4, 2025, the patch increased <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Damage\">ice sensitivity</a> and energy sensitivity.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><i>There is no loot data for this creature. Please consider subtmitting loot logs for this creature using the Loot Statistics parser.</i>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Creatures\">Related Creatures</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dreamhaunters\">Dreamhaunters</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Animated%20Guzzlemaw\">Animated Guzzlemaw</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bad%20Dream\">Bad Dream</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Choking%20Fear\">Choking Fear</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Countess%20Sorrow\">Countess Sorrow</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Outcast\">Demon Outcast</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Enfeebled%20Silencer\">Enfeebled Silencer</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Feversleep\">Feversleep</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Frazzlemaw\">Frazzlemaw</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Guilt\">Guilt</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Guzzlemaw\">Guzzlemaw</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Haunter\">Haunter</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Herald%20of%20Gloom\">Herald of Gloom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Horadron\">Horadron</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lagatos\">Lagatos</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mawhawk\">Mawhawk</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Me